/**
 * The edit model (§11).
 *
 * Injected dependencies, all supplied by the integrator:
 *
 * - `columns` — `{ get(id): ResolvedColumn|undefined, visible(): ResolvedColumn[] }` (area C).
 * - `rows` — `{ byKey(key): Row|undefined, at(index): Row|undefined, count(): number }`
 *   (this area's `RowModel`, or the source).
 * - `emit(type, payload, origin)` — the event bus.
 * - `grid` — passed straight through to user callbacks as `p.grid`.
 * - `context` — `config.context`, passed to user callbacks.
 * - `config` — the `EditConfig` of §18.1.
 */
